@startuml
title Main User Flow (AH-OSP)
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant "Browser (Vue SPA)" as Browser
participant "Laravel (BFF)" as BFF
participant "Microsoft Entra ID" as EntraID
participant "Redis Cache" as Cache
participant "PostgreSQL (Session)" as DB
participant "External APIs" as API

== Authentication Flow (LOGIN) ==

User -> Browser: Access Application
Browser -> BFF: GET /
BFF -> Browser: Redirect to Entra ID (FO Pagina di Login)
Browser -> EntraID: Present Login Screen
User -> EntraID: Enter Credentials & Authenticate
alt Invalid Credentials
    EntraID -> User: Show Error / Prompt Retry
else Valid Credentials
    EntraID -> Browser: Redirect with Auth Code
    Browser -> BFF: Callback (auth/azure/callback)
    BFF -> EntraID: Exchange Code for Token
    EntraID -> BFF: Access Token & User Info
    BFF -> DB: Store User Session
    BFF -> API: GET /users/me (Check Super User / Roles)
    API -> BFF: User Details
    opt is Super User?
        BFF -> Browser: Prompt 'Scelta Struttura' (Choose Facility)
        Browser -> BFF: POST /set-struttura
    end
    BFF -> Browser: Redirect to /home
end

== Home Page Load (HEADER & CONTENUTO HOME PAGE) ==

User -> Browser: Navigate to Home
Browser -> BFF: GET /home (Inertia Request)

par Fetch Dashboard Data
    BFF -> Cache: Check Cache (News, Banners)
    alt Cache Miss
        BFF -> API: GET /news & GET /banners
        API -> BFF: Communications & Banners
        BFF -> Cache: Store in Cache
    end
    
    BFF -> API: GET /orders/latest (Ultimi ordini effettuati)
    API -> BFF: Latest Orders Data
end

BFF -> Browser: Inertia Render (Home Component + Data)

== Menu Interaction: Products & Cart ==

User -> Browser: Search/Select Product (Menu: Prodotti)
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/products?query=...
BFF -> API: GET /products
API -> BFF: Product List / Details
BFF -> Browser: Display Products (Tabella/Lista)

User -> Browser: Add to Cart
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/cart
BFF -> API: POST /cart
API -> BFF: Cart Updated (Verifica disponibilità)
BFF -> Browser: Update Cart Badge in Header

== Checkout Flow (Menu: Carrello) ==

User -> Browser: Proceed to Checkout (Finalizza online)
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/checkout
BFF -> API: Check User Permissions (Permessi invio ordine?)
API -> BFF: Permission Status

alt Has direct order permission (or is Super User)
    BFF -> API: POST /orders (Invio ordine)
    API -> BFF: Order Confirmed
else Needs approval
    BFF -> API: POST /orders/request (Invia richiesta di finalizzazione)
    API -> BFF: Request Pending Approval
end

BFF -> Browser: Display Order Status / Confirmation

@enduml
